                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "bf3ba820-f8a9-4199-8f54-46ac5ca5c82c",
                                "sense_id": "8a5dedc5-ca45-37de-9fda-82ec344d765e",
                                "text": "Seyng therefore, that there is no Dinumeration of tyme with God, it followeth that a thousande yeres with hym, are as one daie […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5d955055-e3bf-4616-9df9-b45840bb57b3",
                                "sense_id": "8a5dedc5-ca45-37de-9fda-82ec344d765e",
                                "text": "What therefore do Philosophers number, measure, waigh? All things: yet have they most solemn dinumerations, dimensions, collibrations, ( 1 ) of Heaven, in Astronomy; ( 2 ) of Earth, in Geographie; ( 3 ) of Times, in Chronology; (4) of Cogitations, in Logick, Mnemonick, Prognostic; (5) of Moral Actions, in Morality; (6) of Speech, in Arts Philological; all of which let us run thorow by the by."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1efa930d-036c-4294-acc0-d622e336fc70",
                                "sense_id": "8a5dedc5-ca45-37de-9fda-82ec344d765e",
                                "text": "I proceed to the Diagnosis; and with this dinumeration of symptoms, I shall take leave of the reader."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "46acfc35-6e87-4c45-b22b-ae1862f788b4",
                                "sense_id": "8a5dedc5-ca45-37de-9fda-82ec344d765e",
                                "text": "[…] this I assert, my lord, ofter a personal and patient dinumeration of their troops and resources: the quod dubitas ne feceris is ever present to my imagination; but as it may not suffice that I possess the esential^([sic]) requisites of self-confidence an self-conviction, I do farther aver, and I pledge my head, nay my reputation and my honour as an officer"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "55bcf5e9-b44c-4bdc-8e02-6196f7fbbc1f",
                                "sense_id": "8a5dedc5-ca45-37de-9fda-82ec344d765e",
                                "text": "I used a technique called dinumeration, where you list off points one by one."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
